sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(241,236,226) Outside the device
        participant Host as Host PC
    end
    box rgb(251,230,218) Device
        participant MCU
        participant Sensor as Temperature sensor
    end
    Host->>MCU: Start measuring
    rect rgb(252,228,243)
        Note over MCU,Sensor: Every 10 ms (timing band)
        MCU->>Sensor: Read temperature (I2C)
        Sensor-->>MCU: Value
    end
    rect rgb(253,237,235)
        MCU->>Sensor: Read temperature
        Sensor--xMCU: NACK (error band)
    end
    rect rgb(242,251,208)
        Note over Host,MCU: ❓ Should the host confirm each value? [WDYT?]
        MCU->>Host: Value
    end
    Host->>MCU: Stop
